Take the left end in the left hand, and the right end in the right hand.
Cross the two ends, and put the top of the left end through the hole, 
created by the shoe and the two crossed ends. Pull both ends (at their
top), without breaking them. Take left end in right hand and right end
in left hand. Make a loop in the right end (in your left hand), and
bend the left end around the loop. Push the middle of the left end 
through the hole created by bending the left end around the loop, thus
creating a second loop with the left end. Pull at both loops at the 
same time, without breaking the ties.

